    "screen": "agents-authorization-owner-06",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "技术实现与依据（二）",
        "size": "large",
        "heading_icon": "_library/hires-icons/打勾清单.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "- **无限制授权（本人接管）：** 本人主动要时，AI 直接调用已安装的 `C:\\ProgramData\\PCConfig\\AuthorityHost\\tools\\Invoke-OwnerTakeover.ps1 -Operation Open`，回执写明 `grant_type=unrestricted`。本人在独立窗口填写有限时长并完成一种已登记因子，之后由宿主 Hook 自动消费，不要求 AI 手工串联内部步骤。默认只管当前对话，明确选全局才扩大；原截止不随新默认、重连、换模型或子代理滑动。",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
